OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1786744248
OL,3,CChannel Islands surpass England for
OL,4,Coverall A-Level pass rate
OL,6,FAlmost all sixth-formers in the
OL,7,FChannel Islands have passed their A-
OL,8,FLevel and Level 3 exams.
OL,10,FHundreds of students attended their
OL,11,Frespective schools and colleges to
OL,12,Fanxiously receive their results.
OL,14,FThe overall pass rates for both
OL,15,FBailiwicks was more than 98%, higher
OL,16,Fthan those of A-Level students in
OL,17,FEngland.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G1/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,356,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35502
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1786744248
OL,3,CChannel Islands surpass England for
OL,4,Coverall A-Level pass rate
OL,6,FHowever, it was Guernsey that topped
OL,7,Fthe pass rate chart, with less than 1%
OL,8,Fof the island's grades not ranked A*
OL,9,Fto E.
OL,11,FThe island's Education Committee
OL,12,FPresident, Deputy Paul Montague, says
OL,13,Fthat the day "never loses its
OL,14,Femotional impact".
OL,16,F"A grade is a stage on the journey,
OL,17,Fnot the destination," he explains.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G2/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,356,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35503
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1786744248
OL,3,CChannel Islands surpass England for
OL,4,Coverall A-Level pass rate
OL,6,F"The real achievement is everything
OL,7,Fthat sits behind it; the times you
OL,8,Fkept going, the hours of coursework,
OL,9,Fthe nerves you overcame to sit the
OL,10,Fexams themselves."
OL,12,FPassing grades are between A* and E.
OL,13,FGuernsey results include students at
OL,14,Fthe Sixth Form Centre with
OL,15,FInternational Baccalaureate
OL,16,FCertificates, which are equal
OL,17,Fqualifications.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G3/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
