PN,35504
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1786744248
OL,3,CChannel Islands surpass England for
OL,4,Coverall A-Level pass rate
OL,6,FIn Jersey, students achieved 79.4% for
OL,7,FA* to C passes, with 99% of Highlands
OL,8,FCollege's sixth-form students passing
OL,9,Ftheir professional and technical
OL,10,Fqualifications.
OL,12,FJersey's Education Minister, Deputy
OL,13,FCatherine Curtis, adds: "As you now
OL,14,Fmove towards university, vocational
OL,15,Fstudies, or join the world of work,
OL,16,Fthis is a well-deserved reminder of
OL,17,Fthe hard work and dedication you have
OL,18,Fshown throughout your studies."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G4/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
