PN,35505
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1786744248
OL,3,CChannel Islands surpass England for
OL,4,Coverall A-Level pass rate
OL,6,FGuernsey's Sixth Form Centre cohort of
OL,7,F155 students achieved 455 subject
OL,8,Fpasses across A-Level and IB, with an
OL,9,Foverall pass rate of 98.9%.
OL,11,FPrincipal Kieran James explains: "The
OL,12,Fproportion of students achieving A*/A,
OL,13,FInternational Baccalaureate 7/6,
OL,14,Fgrades has risen significantly, from
OL,15,F18% to 23%.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G5/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,356,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35506
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1786744248
OL,3,CChannel Islands surpass England for
OL,4,Coverall A-Level pass rate
OL,6,F"These results reflect an enormous
OL,7,Famount of hard work by our students,
OL,8,Fwho should be incredibly proud of all
OL,9,Fthey have achieved, and by the
OL,10,Fdedicated staff who have supported and
OL,11,Fchampioned them every step of the way."
OL,13,FThe States of Guernsey also reported
OL,14,Fthat technical and vocational students
OL,15,Fat The Guernsey Institute are
OL,16,Fcelebrating "some great personal
OL,17,Fachievements".
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G6/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
