CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1786744248
OL,3,CChannel Islands surpass England for
OL,4,Coverall A-Level pass rate
OL,6,FBoth Bailiwicks saw more than a
OL,7,Fquarter of students receiving A*-A
OL,8,Fequivalent grades, with Guernsey again
OL,9,Fsurpassing Jersey's top marks.
OL,11,FHowever, it was students in England
OL,12,Fwho garnered the largest proportion of
OL,13,Ftop grades this academic year.
OL,15,FPercentage of students receiving A*-A
OL,16,Fequivalent grades in 2026:
OL,18,FAt Hautlieu School, two students
OL,19,Fopened their results with ITV Channel.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G7/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
