FL,356,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35508
SC,0008
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1786744248
OL,3,CChannel Islands surpass England for
OL,4,Coverall A-Level pass rate
OL,6,FPedro studied Biology, Business,
OL,7,FSpanish, and Portuguese, and was
OL,8,Fpredicted to get four Cs.
OL,10,FHowever, he got three Bs and a C and
OL,11,Fhopes the good results put him on the
OL,12,Fpath to work towards a nursing degree.
OL,14,FAva took Economics, Business, and
OL,15,FPhysical Education. Despite being
OL,16,Fpredicted three As, she got top marks
OL,17,Fwith A*s across the board.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G8/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,356,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35509
SC,0009
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1786744248
OL,3,CChannel Islands surpass England for
OL,4,Coverall A-Level pass rate
OL,6,F"I wasn't expecting that," Ava told
OL,7,FITV News. "I thought I failed
OL,8,FEconomics. It's not been my strongest
OL,9,Fsubject, but it means that I'm off to
OL,10,Funi now."
OL,12,FStudents also received good news at
OL,13,FGuernsey Institute.
OL,15,FArchie, who studied Performing Arts,
OL,16,Ftold ITV News: "I was really nervous -
OL,17,FI was shaking, because it matters a
OL,18,Flot what results you get in the first
OL,19,Fyear because you get a pass or a fail;
OL,20,Fyou don't go into the next year.
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws         G9/10
OL,2,W+.!/*%/*%/*%/*%+,"-$ /(,'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BCh Is News CThis Day FReg TV
FL,356,350,120,260,000,100
PN,35510
SC,0010
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F355A1786744248
OL,3,CChannel Islands surpass England for
OL,4,Coverall A-Level pass rate
OL,6,F"I opened my results in the car with
OL,7,Fmy friends, and I managed to get a
OL,8,Fdistinction, I'm really happy with my
OL,9,Fresult."
OL,11,FGeorgia was also pleased to receive a
OL,12,FDistinction Star in her Public
OL,13,FServices course, alongside her friend
OL,14,FDaisy who earned the same grade in
OL,15,FHealth and Social Care.
OL,17,F"I want to work in child protection or
OL,18,Fsocial work," Daisy explained. "I was
OL,19,Fa bit nervous, but feel very relieved
OL,20,Fnow and happy."
OL,1,W~+$z5~{4~k4~k4~sj5  hws        G10/10
